#. 5.6->settings-schema.json->CPU_explanationStuckProcess->description
msgid ""
"There are several ways to detect stuck processes:\n"
"- through the kernel; this is reported immediately.\n"
"- through analyzis of each CPU's activity; this is reported when at least "
"one CPU exceeds the specified activity threshold for the set time limit.\n"
"- through either method; the response time depends on how the stuck process "
"was detected."
msgstr ""

